    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Number of high-level regional conference on BRI organized
2. Number of official social media accounts established on different platforms
3. Number of communication materials (brochures, infographics, videos) been devised
4. A strategic and operational plan for establishment of the Institute been developed
5. A financial sustainability plan for the Institute been developed
6. A dedicated bilingual (English &amp; Chinese) project staff been recruited</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2020">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 0
2. 0
3. 0
4. N
5. N
6. N</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 high-level regional conference on BRI organized in Serbia.
2.At least 3 official social media accounts established on different platforms.
3.At least 3 communication materials (brochures, infographics, videos, etc.) been developed.
4.An operational plan for establishment of the Institute been developed.
5.A financial sustainability plan for the Institute been developed.
6.A team of staff is fully on-board, responsible for management, implementation and operation of the Institute, with support from a dedicated bilingual (English &amp; Chinese) project staff recruited.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Postponed for 2021 due to COVID-19 pandemic and international travel restrictions.
2.Yes, communication consultant engaged and social media accounts established on different platforms
3. Yes, communication materials developed.
4. Yes, the Government of Serbia adopted a decision related to establishment of the Belt and Road Institute.
5. Yes, financial sustainability plan developed.
6. No. As Institute has been recently established, its full operationalization, including recruitment of dedicated bilingual staff, is expected in 2022.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2020-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2020-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1 high-level regional conference on BRI organized in Serbia.
2.At least 3 official social media accounts established on different platforms.
3.At least 3 communication materials (brochures, infographics, videos, etc.) been developed.
4.A strategic and operational plan for establishment of the Institute been developed.
5.A financial sustainability plan for the Institute been developed.
6.A team of staff is fully on-board, responsible for management, implementation and operation of the Institute, with support from a dedicated bilingual (English &amp; Chinese) project staff recruited.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.Strategic plan, with accompanying documents needed for the BRI establishment, has been developed.
2.Two consultants have been engaged in the first quarter of 2020 to support the setup of the programmatic and institutional framework related to the BRI in Serbia. In the second quarter Portfolio Manager and Technical Advisor have been engaged to support the BRI foundation and future implementation and operation.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">4.1 1 high-level regional conference organized
4.2 At least 3 official social media accounts established on different platforms
4.3 At least 3 communication materials (brochures, infographics, videos) been devised
4.4 A strategic and operational plan for the operation of the Institute developed 
4.5 A financial sustainability plan for the Institute been developed 
4.6 A dedicated bilingual (English &amp; Chinese) project staff has been recruited</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">4.1. Yes. Two Think-Tank events organized in 2022, with significant support from the Chinese Embassy.
4.2. Yes. Social media accounts established on all social networks.
4.3. Yes. Different brochures, infographics, handouts, press releases, social media posts and other communication materials have been developed.
4.4. Yes. Institute is now entering a new phase of development which envisages that the Belt and Road Institute becomes a Center of Excellence for engagement within the Belt and Road Initiative, which is aligned with the Sustainable Development Goals in Europe.
4.5. Yes. Financial sustainability plan has been developed and resource mobilization process is ongoing.
4.6. No. This will be done in the next phase of the Institute&#x2019;s development (2023-2024).</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
